<p>Yeah, the interview was kind of hard to put together. Leveritas did some double-translation (English to Dutch, Dutch back to English) to try and get a sense of a different speaking pattern, but it might not have been the language best-suited for that approach. Also the overall feel isn't so much gut-punch &quot;dear lord that's terrifying&quot; but more a thin veneer of &quot;something is wrong here&quot; <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">because horror writing is hard :(</span>. Sort of playing off the concept of &quot;the way to tell you have conquered your fear is to arrive at a place where you can welcome it&quot;, but that's just a lot of discussion while brainstorming and we did do a fair bit of trimming.</p>
